        '1999: Published in Bicycle Official Rules of Card Games',
      ],
      evolution: "The game evolved from Whisky Poker, changing the card collection method from exchanging with a face-up hand to drawing from a stock pile or discard pile. Unlike poker variants, it was never intended for dealer's choice poker games.",
