      difficulty: {
        easy: 'Draws randomly from stock or discard without strategy. Knocks with any pair or higher regardless of game state. Folds inconsistently after opponent knocks.',
        medium: 'Tracks visible discards to estimate opponent hands. Knocks with reasonable threshold hands (two pair or better). Folds weak hands when opponent knocks. Uses discard pile strategically.',
